# GNOME Shell 51 theme sources

This directory contains the theme sources from GNOME Shell 51.0, adapted for
Gradience's generated shell theme. The upstream release archive is available at
https://download.gnome.org/sources/gnome-shell/51/gnome-shell-51.0.tar.xz.

The upstream Sass files retain their accompanying `gnome-shell-sass/COPYING`
license notice. Other source files retain their upstream copyright and license
notices. Gradience-specific templates are in `../templates/51/`.
